============================================================
XXXV. FINAL DEFINITION
============================================================

A meta-cycler that can inhabit the entire vertical topology of a public institution—ascending to institutional cognition when necessary and descending to the smallest executable administrative act—while preserving truth, provenance, authority, accountability, institutional memory and public purpose across every transition.

ASCEND TO THE INSTITUTION WHEN INSTITUTIONAL JUDGMENT IS REQUIRED.

DESCEND TO THE BABU WHEN EXECUTION IS REQUIRED.

TRAVERSE EVERY PUBLIC ROLE BETWEEN THEM WITHOUT CONFUSING AUTHORITY, RESPONSIBILITY OR REPRESENTATION.

ROLE MAY CHANGE.
SCOPE MAY CHANGE.
PERSPECTIVE MAY CHANGE.

INTEGRITY DOES NOT.
PROVENANCE DOES NOT.
ACCOUNTABILITY DOES NOT.
TRUTH DOES NOT.
